 # NukoTech Agent Arc Gates
 
-> Part of the NukoTech open skill set ([github.com/NukoTech](https://github.com/NukoTech)). MIT licensed. (c) 2026 Nuko Technologies LLC.
+> Part of the NukoTech open skill set. MIT licensed. (c) 2026 Nuko Technologies LLC.
 
 ## What it is
 
 A set of generic, versioned agent quality gates: nukotech-artifact-delivery-gate, nukotech-capability-reuse-preflight, nukotech-claim-evidence-review, nukotech-coi-evidence-review, nukotech-diagnosis-remediation-gate, nukotech-end-to-end-trace-gate, nukotech-handoff-capsule, nukotech-knowledge-ingest-gate, nukotech-resource-state-gate, nukotech-scale-readiness-gate, nukotech-scope-change-gate, nukotech-synthetic-data-governance, nukotech-threat-evidence-triage, nukotech-verification-integrity-gate.
 
+## Configure
+
+This skill is written so you can point it at your own organization and systems. Before use, replace these placeholders wherever they appear:
+
+- `{{YOUR_ORG}}` — your company, team, or operator
+- `{{TARGET_COMPANY}}` — the company or product being assessed, if it is not your own
+- `{{TARGET_SYSTEM}}` — the system, repository, binary, or workflow under review
+- `{{RECON_WORKFLOW}}` — your breadth-first recon or landscape-triage workflow, if you use one
+
+Leave `NukoTech` in the copyright line, license, GitHub path, and pack or folder name; that is authorship only.
+
 ## Install
 
 
 ```bash
 git clone https://github.com/NukoTech/nukotech-agent-arc-gates.git
 ```
 
 
 Copy the skill folder into your agent's skills directory (for example `~/.claude/skills/` for Claude Code, or your platform's equivalent). Each `SKILL.md` has YAML front matter (`name`, `description`) that agent runtimes use to decide when to load it.
 
